            <!-- Motor 3: 18" CCW (Force: 83.37N, Cant: 0, 0) [Data: 3400 13.27 0.31; 3800 16.72 0.39; 4200 20.61 0.48; 4600 24.92 0.58; 5000 29.69 0.69; 5400 34.88 0.81; 5800 40.50 0.93; 6200 46.56 1.07; 6600 53.05 1.22; 7000 59.98 1.38; 7400 67.34 1.55; 7800 75.14 1.73; 8200 83.37 Unit: N] -->
